This crate is a Rust port of the PDQ perceptual hash reference implementation
from facebook/ThreatExchange. It is covered by the BSD 3-Clause license of this
repository (see ../LICENSE), and the upstream notice below is reproduced as that
license requires.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
Meta Platforms, Inc.

The following files are line-by-line ports of upstream sources, and are derived
works of the code covered by the notice below:

  src/lib.rs        <- pdq/cpp/hashing/pdqhashing.cpp
  src/dct.rs        <- pdq/cpp/hashing/pdqhashing.cpp
  src/downscale.rs  <- pdq/cpp/downscaling/downscaling.cpp
  src/hash.rs       <- pdq/cpp/common/pdqhashtypes.{h,cpp}

src/median.rs is a port of pdq/cpp/hashing/torben.cpp, which upstream declares to
be public domain: "Algorithm by Torben Mogensen, implementation by N. Devillard."

src/preprocess.rs reproduces the observable behaviour of CImg's nearest-neighbor
resize, because the upstream CLI applies it before hashing. It is an independent
implementation; no CImg code was copied. CImg itself is licensed under CeCILL-C
and is not included in this repository.


